# .deadcodeignore
# Only hertz and gorm generated code is allowed to be ignored.
# All hand-written code (domain / service / workflow / policy / dal/repo /
# config / observability / infra / middleware / handler business logic /
# main.go / wire.go / wire_gen.go) MUST stay in the detection scope.
#
# Default patterns already in tools/deadcheck/main.go (loadIgnorePatterns):
#   /biz/model/                  - hertz IDL model (generated)
#   /biz/router/                 - hertz route registration (generated)
#   router_gen\.go:              - hertz router entry (generated)
#   \.pb\.go:                    - protobuf generated
#   (?i)code generated           - standard generated marker
#   (?i)/generated/              - generated directory
#
# Paths below include both forward-slash (Unix) and backslash (Windows)
# variants because deadcode emits native paths.
